```mermaid
flowchart LR
  %% Kurt Lewin's Change Management Model (circular flow)

  C((Lewin<br/>Model))

  U([Unfreeze<br/><span style="font-size:12px">Preparing the desired change</span>])
  CH([Change<br/><span style="font-size:12px">Implementing the desired change</span>])
  R([Refreeze<br/><span style="font-size:12px">Solidifying the desired change</span>])

  U --> CH --> R --> U

  C --- U
  C --- CH
  C --- R

  classDef center fill:#2f2f2f,stroke:#111,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef unfreeze fill:#27c7c8,stroke:#ffffff,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef change fill:#0aa0ff,stroke:#ffffff,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef refreeze fill:#42c38d,stroke:#ffffff,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px;

  class C center;
  class U unfreeze;
  class CH change;
  class R refreeze;

  linkStyle 0,1,2 stroke:#1fb6ff,stroke-width:6px;
  linkStyle 3,4,5 stroke:#cfcfcf,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
```

